OL,3,GNEWSALenny Rush helps get Eric
OL,4,AMorecambe book on TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe son of Eric Morecambe has revealed
OL,7,Fthat actor Lenny Rush's involvement was
OL,8,Fcrucial to finally bring his father's
OL,9,Fnovel to the screen after 35 years of
OL,10,Ftrying.
OL,12,FGary Morecambe said he had been trying
OL,13,Fto adapt The Reluctant Vampire
OL,14,Fchildren's books for television since
OL,15,Fhis late father asked him to in 1982.
OL,17,FThe comedian, who lived in Harpenden
OL,18,Fwhen he wrote the stories, told his son
OL,19,Fthey "gave him as much pleasure" as his
OL,20,Fcelebrated work with Morecambe and
OL,21,FWise.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
