OL,3,GNEWSALenny Rush helps get Eric
OL,4,AMorecambe book on TV
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter several unsuccessful attempts to
OL,7,Fbring the books to screen, Morecambe
OL,8,Fsaid he had started to lose hope. But
OL,9,Fhe said of the Essex actor's
OL,10,Finvolvement: "Once we made him the star
OL,11,Fof it, everything then just fell into
OL,12,Fplace."
